{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09071","headline":"寄畅当 · 韦应物","name":"寄畅当","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寇贼起东山，英俊方未闲。\n闻君新应募，籍籍动京关。\n出身文翰场，高步不可攀。\n青袍未及解，白羽插腰间。\n昔爲琼树枝，今有风霜颜。\n秋郊细柳道，走马一夕还。\n丈夫当爲国，破敌如摧山。\n何必事州府，坐使鬓毛斑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}